              "hash": "X-Amz-Target=PaymentCryptographyControlPlane.GetParametersForImport"
            },
            "description": "<p>Gets the import token and the wrapping key certificate to initiate a TR-34 key import into Amazon Web Services Payment Cryptography.</p> <p>The wrapping key certificate wraps the key under import within the TR-34 key payload. The import token and wrapping key certificate must be in place and operational before calling <a>ImportKey</a>. The import token expires in 7 days. The same import token can be used to import multiple keys into your service account.</p> <p> <b>Cross-account use:</b> This operation can't be used across different Amazon Web Services accounts.</p> <p> <b>Related operations:</b> </p> <ul> <li> <p> <a>GetParametersForExport</a> </p> </li> <li> <p> <a>ImportKey</a> </p> </li> </ul>"
          },
